{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09571","headline":"潼关镇国军句覆使院早春寄王同州 · 岑参","name":"潼关镇国军句覆使院早春寄王同州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡寇尚未尽，大军镇关门。\n旌旗遍草木，兵马如云屯。\n圣朝正用武，诸将皆承恩。\n不见征战功，但闻歌吹喧。\n儒生有长策，闭口不敢言。\n昨从关东来，思与故人论。\n何爲廊庙器，至今居外藩。\n黄霸宁淹留，苍生望腾骞。\n卷帘见西岳，仙掌明朝暾。\n昨夜闻春风，戴胜过後园。\n各自限官守，何由叙凉温。\n离忧不可忘，襟背思树萱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}